IMPORTANT INFO!

1. The tournaments are under the src/schnapsen/tournaments directory.

2. To run rcBotVsMLBot_tournament.py, run in powershell, the following commands:
>> cd C:\Users\anton\Documents\GitHub\schnapsen-coursework\src [or cd <the path to the tournament folder>]
>> python -m schnapsen.bots.tournaments.rcBotVsMLBot_tournament

3. To run scoreBotVsMLBot_tournament.py, run in powershell, the following commands:
>> cd C:\Users\anton\Documents\GitHub\schnapsen-coursework\src [or cd <the path to the tournament folder>]
>> python -m schnapsen.bots.tournaments.scoreBotVsMLBot_tournament

4. To run the oppReactBotVsMLBot tournament, just run it as usual as any other python program in python debugger.